## Overview

This system enables researchers to select a region of interest (ROI) from a brain histological section and automatically find similar objects/patterns across all available sections in single or multiple biosamples. The pipeline uses deep learning-based feature matching with XFeat neural networks and geometric transformations to identify and visualize matching regions.

### Key Features

- **Multi-Biosample Support**: Process multiple brain specimens simultaneously
- **Multi-Stain Compatibility**: Works with NISSL, MYELIN, H&E, and IHC stains
- **Real-time Progress Tracking**: Celery-based asynchronous processing with live updates
- **Geometric Validation**: RANSAC-based affine transformation estimation
- **Interactive Web Interface**: FastAPI-based REST API with HTML viewer
- **Scalable Processing**: Automatic queue management based on dataset size

