## Data Flow

### Complete Processing Pipeline

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Selects ROI] --> B[Extract Bounding Box Coordinates]
    B --> C[Query Project Configuration]
    C --> D[Create Reference Image from ROI]
    D --> E[Load XFeat Neural Network]
    E --> F[Get All Available Biosamples]
    F --> G[Process Each Biosample-Stain Combination]
    
    G --> H[Load Target Section Thumbnails]
    H --> I[Extract Features with XFeat]
    I --> J[Match Features Between Reference and Target]
    J --> K[Apply RANSAC Geometric Validation]
    K --> L[Calculate Local Consensus Confidence]
    L --> M[Filter High-Confidence Matches]
    M --> N[Warp ROI Corners to Target Space]
    N --> O[Generate Match Visualization]
    O --> P[Save Results to Output Directory]
    
    P --> Q[Update Progress Tracking]
    Q --> R{More Sections?}
    R -->|Yes| H
    R -->|No| S[Complete Biosample Processing]
    
    S --> T{More Biosamples?}
    T -->|Yes| G
    T -->|No| U[Return Final Results]
```

